+PalletTown_HarperHouse_Text_Resident1::
+    .string "When I was a boy, PALLET was\n"
+    .string "two houses and a lab.\p"
+    .string "Now there's a POKéMON\n"
+    .string "CENTER, a café, even a\l"
+    .string "school!\p"
+    .string "Still the same sea breeze,\n"
+    .string "though. That never changes.$"
+
